<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
            <span class="contribute__eyebrow">Contributing</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">How to get involved</h2>
            <p class="section-head__subtitle">Everything goes through the GitLab group. Pick whichever fits what you have.</p>
        </div>

        <ol class="contribute-steps">
            <li class="contribute-step">
                <h3 class="contribute-step__title">Report a bug</h3>
                <p class="contribute-step__text">Found something broken? Open an issue in the GitLab group with what you ran and what happened.</p>
            </li>

            <li class="contribute-step">
                <h3 class="contribute-step__title">Request a port</h3>
                <p class="contribute-step__text">Missing a package? Ask for it in the GitLab group, or write the build script yourself and share it.</p>
            </li>

            <li class="contribute-step">
                <h3 class="contribute-step__title">Send a patch</h3>
                <p class="contribute-step__text">Fixed a bug or improved a port? Open a merge request with your change so the maintainers can review it.</p>
            </li>
        </ol>

        <div class="contribute__actions">
            <a href="{{ gitlabUrl }}" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open GitLab group</a>
            <a href="{{ portsRepoUrl }}" class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Browse ports repository</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
